  "reason": "Delegated risk acceptance, not patched dependencies. Only braces (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm, <=3.0.3) and node-forge (GHSA-86w9-cpqp-85rv, <=1.4.0) remain; neither has a patched release on 2026-10-18. braces is reached only through micromatch in Metro/Jest/RN CLI file matching on developer and build machines; node-forge only through @expo/cli code-signing at build time. Native Android/iOS Metro graphs ship neither. grpc-js was patched by override (1.14.5) and decode-uri-component removed by react-navigation 7.5 (core 7.23 dropped query-string). Re-review on any lock or advisory change. No blanket severity ignore.",
